#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:1
msgid "Manage business invoices"
msgstr "Gestiona las facturas de tu negocio"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:3
msgid ""
"Record the invoices your business issues and receives: the money a "
"customer owes you and the money you owe a supplier. This guide covers "
"both kinds and shows which records feed your tax calculations."
msgstr ""
"Registra las facturas que tu negocio emite y recibe: el dinero que un "
"cliente le debe y el dinero que debes a un proveedor. Esta guía cubre "
"ambos tipos y muestra qué registros alimentan sus cálculos fiscales."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:7
msgid ""
"A business invoice is not the same as a purchase receipt you attach as "
"evidence. Receipts support a deductible expense on a ledger transaction "
"(see [Attach invoices and receipts](ledger-evidence.md)). Business "
"invoices recorded here are the commercial documents themselves: an "
"*issued* invoice (you billed a customer) or a *received* invoice (a "
"supplier billed you)."
msgstr ""
"Una factura de negocio no es lo mismo que un recibo de compra que "
"adjuntas como evidencia. Los recibos respaldan un gasto deducible en un "
"movimiento del ledger (consulta [Adjunta facturas y "
"recibos](ledger-evidence.md)). Las facturas de negocio que se registran "
"aquí son los documentos comerciales en sí: una factura *emitida* "
"(facturaste a un cliente) o una factura *recibida* (un proveedor le "
"facturó)."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:13
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Antes de empezar"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:15
msgid "You need:"
msgstr "Necesita:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:17
msgid ""
"An active taxpayer profile. Every command below works on the active "
"profile; if none is set, the command refuses. See [Set up your taxpayer "
"profile](profile-setup.md)."
msgstr ""
"Un perfil de contribuyente activo. Todos los comandos siguientes operan "
"sobre el perfil activo; si no hay ninguno definido, el comando se niega a"
" continuar. Consulta [Configura tu perfil de contribuyente](profile-"
"setup.md)."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:20
msgid ""
"A master-key passphrase. The tool prompts for it the first time it opens "
"your encrypted storage in a session."
msgstr ""
"Una frase de contraseña de la clave maestra. La herramienta la solicita "
"la primera vez que abre su almacenamiento cifrado en una sesión."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:23
msgid ""
"The `aeat` command-line interface (CLI) emits its help and messages in "
"Spanish; the English text on this page describes what each step does."
msgstr ""
"La interfaz de línea de comandos (CLI) `aeat` muestra su ayuda y sus "
"mensajes en español; el texto en inglés de esta página describe qué hace "
"cada paso."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:26
msgid "Two ways to hold an invoice"
msgstr "Dos formas de guardar una factura"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:28
msgid "Cadrumo keeps invoices in two separate places, for two different jobs."
msgstr ""
"Cadrumo guarda las facturas en dos lugares distintos, para dos cometidos "
"diferentes."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:30
msgid ""
"**The invoice record** (`aeat app ledger invoice ...`) is your "
"bookkeeping ledger of who owes you and whom you owe. Use it to record, "
"list, and edit invoices. These records are for tracking; on their own "
"they do **not** feed a modelo calculation."
msgstr ""
"**El registro de factura** (`aeat app ledger invoice ...`) es su libro "
"contable de quién le debe y a quién debe. Úsalo para registrar, listar y "
"editar facturas. Estos registros sirven para el seguimiento; por sí solos"
" **no** alimentan el cálculo de un modelo."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:34
msgid ""
"**The reconciliation catalogue** (`aeat app ledger invoice catalogue "
"...`) is the linkable copy. A catalogue invoice can be matched to a bank "
"transaction and is the copy a calculation reads, for example the Modelo "
"349 recapitulative declaration of intra-community operations."
msgstr ""
"**El catálogo de conciliación** (`aeat app ledger invoice catalogue ...`)"
" es la copia vinculable. Una factura del catálogo puede casarse con un "
"movimiento bancario y es la copia que lee un cálculo, por ejemplo la "
"declaración recapitulativa de operaciones intracomunitarias del Modelo "
"349."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:39
msgid ""
"Record everyday invoices with `invoice add`. When an invoice must drive a"
" calculation or be reconciled against a payment, also create it in the "
"catalogue with `invoice catalogue create`."
msgstr ""
"Registra las facturas cotidianas con `invoice add`. Cuando una factura "
"deba impulsar un cálculo o conciliarse con un pago, créala además en el "
"catálogo con `invoice catalogue create`."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:43
msgid ""
"Every command takes `--kind issued` or `--kind received`. *Issued* means "
"a customer owes you (a collectible invoice); *received* means you owe a "
"supplier (a payable invoice)."
msgstr ""
"Todos los comandos aceptan `--kind issued` o `--kind received`. *Issued* "
"significa que un cliente le debe (una factura por cobrar); *received* "
"significa que debes a un proveedor (una factura por pagar)."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:47
msgid "Record an issued invoice"
msgstr "Registra una factura emitida"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:49
msgid ""
"Record an invoice you sent to a customer. The command returns the new "
"`invoice_id`, the resolved `source_kind` (`collectible_invoice`), and the"
" values you entered:"
msgstr ""
"Registra una factura que envió a un cliente. El comando devuelve el nuevo"
" `invoice_id`, el `source_kind` resuelto (`collectible_invoice`) y los "
"valores que introdujo:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:57
msgid ""
"Record the short `invoice_id`; you address the invoice by it (or by an "
"unambiguous prefix)."
msgstr ""
"Anota el `invoice_id` corto; con él (o con un prefijo inequívoco) se "
"refiere a la factura."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:60
msgid "Record a received invoice"
msgstr "Registra una factura recibida"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:62
msgid ""
"Record an invoice a supplier sent you. The `source_kind` resolves to "
"`payable_invoice`:"
msgstr ""
"Registra una factura que le envió un proveedor. El `source_kind` se "
"resuelve a `payable_invoice`:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:69
msgid "List, view, update, and remove"
msgstr "Lista, consulta, actualiza y elimina"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:71
msgid ""
"List both kinds or filter to one, add a note to a stored invoice, then "
"remove it. The view of one invoice takes its id (or an unambiguous "
"prefix) and the kind:"
msgstr ""
"Lista ambos tipos o filtra por uno, añade una nota a una factura guardada"
" y elimínala después. La consulta de una factura toma su id (o un prefijo"
" inequívoco) y el tipo:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:78
msgid "Record an intra-community invoice"
msgstr "Registra una factura intracomunitaria"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:80
msgid ""
"A supply to, or acquisition from, a VAT-registered business in another EU"
" country is an intra-community operation. Record it on the issued or "
"received invoice with the counterparty's country and EU VAT id, plus the "
"Modelo 349 operation type:"
msgstr ""
"Una entrega a, o una adquisición de, una empresa registrada a efectos de "
"IVA en otro país de la UE es una operación intracomunitaria. Regístrala "
"en la factura emitida o recibida con el país y el número de IVA europeo "
"de la contraparte, más el tipo de operación del Modelo 349:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:89
msgid ""
"`--operation-type` takes one M349 operation key: `E` supplies of goods, "
"`M` supplies after an exempt import, `H` the same via a fiscal "
"representative, `A` acquisitions of goods, `T` triangular supplies, `S` "
"services supplied, `I` services acquired, and the call-off-stock keys `R`"
" (transfers), `D` (returns), and `C` (substitutions)."
msgstr ""
"`--operation-type` toma una clave de operación del M349: `E` entregas de "
"bienes, `M` entregas tras una importación exenta, `H` lo mismo mediante "
"representante fiscal, `A` adquisiciones de bienes, `T` entregas "
"triangulares, `S` servicios prestados, `I` servicios adquiridos, y las "
"claves de ventas en consigna `R` (transferencias), `D` (devoluciones) y "
"`C` (sustituciones)."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:95
msgid "Feed a calculation from the catalogue"
msgstr "Alimenta un cálculo desde el catálogo"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:97
msgid ""
"To make an invoice reach a modelo calculation, create it in the "
"catalogue. The catalogue copy is the one a calculation reads and the one "
"you can link to a bank transaction. The sequence catalogues an intra-"
"community supply, lists and inspects the catalogue, then creates and "
"calculates the Modelo 349 recapitulative declaration for the period the "
"invoice falls in:"
msgstr ""
"Para que una factura llegue al cálculo de un modelo, créala en el "
"catálogo. La copia del catálogo es la que lee un cálculo y la que puedes "
"vincular a un movimiento bancario. La secuencia cataloga una entrega "
"intracomunitaria, lista e inspecciona el catálogo, y luego crea y calcula "
"la declaración recapitulativa del Modelo 349 para el periodo en el que "
"cae la factura:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:107
msgid ""
"For an intra-community operation, pass `--operation-type` so the "
"catalogue stamps the classification the Modelo 349 calculation reads. Use"
" `E`, `H`, `M`, `S`, `T`, `R`, `D`, or `C` for issued catalogue invoices."
" Use `A`, `I`, or `T` for received catalogue invoices. In Modelo 349, `R`"
" is the call-off-stock transfer key; rectification rows use separate "
"rectified-period and base fields."
msgstr ""
"Para una operación intracomunitaria, pasa `--operation-type` para que el "
"catálogo estampe la clasificación que lee el cálculo del Modelo 349. Usa "
"`E`, `H`, `M`, `S`, `T`, `R`, `D` o `C` para las facturas emitidas del "
"catálogo. Usa `A`, `I` o `T` para las facturas recibidas del catálogo. En"
" el Modelo 349, `R` es la clave de transferencia de ventas en consigna; "
"las filas de rectificación usan campos separados de periodo rectificado y"
" base."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:113
msgid ""
"An invoice is counted only in the period its invoice date falls in. "
"Modelo 349 reads invoices strictly by date, with no carry-forward from "
"earlier periods."
msgstr ""
"Una factura se computa solo en el periodo en el que cae su fecha de "
"factura. El Modelo 349 lee las facturas estrictamente por fecha, sin "
"arrastre de periodos anteriores."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:116
msgid "Link a catalogue invoice to a transaction"
msgstr "Vincula una factura del catálogo a un movimiento"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:118
msgid ""
"Link a catalogue invoice to the bank transaction that paid or collected "
"it. The sequence records a transaction, catalogues an invoice, links "
"them, and confirms the link on the catalogue copy:"
msgstr ""
"Vincula una factura del catálogo al movimiento bancario que la pagó o la "
"cobró. La secuencia registra un movimiento, cataloga una factura, los "
"vincula y confirma el vínculo en la copia del catálogo:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:126
msgid ""
"Remove a catalogue invoice you created by mistake, confirming with "
"`--yes`. Unlink the invoice first if it is still linked to a transaction:"
" a removal of a still-linked invoice is refused, so the bank transaction "
"never ends up citing an invoice that no longer exists:"
msgstr ""
"Elimina una factura del catálogo que creó por error, confirmando con "
"`--yes`. Desvincula primero la factura si sigue vinculada a un "
"movimiento: la eliminación de una factura aún vinculada se rechaza, de "
"modo que el movimiento bancario nunca acaba citando una factura que ya no"
" existe:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:135
msgid "Which modelos read your invoices"
msgstr "Qué modelos leen sus facturas"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:137
msgid ""
"Catalogue invoices feed **Modelo 349** (the recapitulative declaration of"
" intra-community operations) through the operation type you stamp on them"
" when you create them. This is the modelo your issued and received "
"invoices drive directly."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas del catálogo alimentan el **Modelo 349** (la declaración "
"recapitulativa de operaciones intracomunitarias) mediante el tipo de "
"operación que les estampas al crearlas. Este es el modelo que sus "
"facturas emitidas y recibidas impulsan directamente."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:142
msgid ""
"Your **IVA returns do not read these invoice records**. Modelo 303 "
"(quarterly IVA) and Modelo 390 (annual IVA summary) are computed from "
"your classified ledger transactions, not from the invoice catalogue. "
"Record the income and expense in the ledger and classify it (see "
"[Classify transactions](classify-transactions.md)); the IVA returns read "
"the ledger. Recording an invoice here does not add it to a Modelo 303."
msgstr ""
"Sus **autoliquidaciones de IVA no leen estos registros de factura**. El "
"Modelo 303 (IVA trimestral) y el Modelo 390 (resumen anual de IVA) se "
"calculan a partir de tus movimientos del ledger clasificados, no a partir"
" del catálogo de facturas. Registra el ingreso y el gasto en el ledger y "
"clasifícalo (consulta [Clasifica los movimientos](classify-"
"transactions.md)); las autoliquidaciones de IVA leen el ledger. Registrar"
" una factura aquí no la añade a un Modelo 303."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:149
msgid ""
"Cross-border B2C sales under the One-Stop-Shop scheme (Modelo 369) are a "
"separate flow not yet reachable from `invoice catalogue create`; record "
"those through the OSS-specific workflow."
msgstr ""
"Las ventas transfronterizas B2C bajo el régimen de ventanilla única "
"(Modelo 369) son un flujo aparte que todavía no es accesible desde "
"`invoice catalogue create`; regístralas mediante el flujo específico de "
"la ventanilla única (OSS)."

